OL,3,GNEWSABluefin tuna permits 'could offer
OL,4,Aamazing fishery'
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey has the potential to be "one
OL,7,Fof the best game fisheries on the
OL,8,Fplanet" should a ban on catching
OL,9,Fbluefin tuna be lifted, an angler has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FLanding bluefin tuna is currently
OL,13,Fprohibited in Guernsey, both
OL,14,Fcommercially and recreationally.
OL,16,FThe Committee for Economic Development
OL,17,Fis putting forward proposals to
OL,18,Fintroduce a permit system for
OL,19,Frecreational bluefin tuna fishing, on a
OL,20,Fcatch-and-release basis, to be debated
OL,21,Flater this year.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
