OL,3,GNEWSABluefin tuna permits 'could offer
OL,4,Aamazing fishery'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA local marine biologist has warned
OL,7,Fimportant steps need to be undertaken
OL,8,Fin Guernsey's existing fisheries,
OL,9,Fbefore the island moved to allow
OL,10,Fbluefin fishing.
